Plan List Habits Check in Countdown to Anniversary
Have you ever experienced a busy day but gained little, and the goal you insisted on is quickly given up? Zomoplan helps you improve efficiency and reminds you to complete your plans and goals.
Manage your free time with perfect time planning.

【Features 】
1. Daily check-in: One tap to complete the daily check-in
2. Habit check-in: Show all the good habits you want to develop
3. Get used to signing up: no longer afraid of forgetting to check in
4. Add habits: customize and add the good habits you want to develop
5. Daily notes: record the changes in daily growth
6. Countdown Anniversary: One-click query for statutory holidays, wedding anniversaries, love anniversaries, menstrual periods, birthdays, one-click settings, expiration reminders
【Habit of checking in】
1. You can set which days of the week to repeat and which time period to execute for each habit;
2. The habits to be adhered to today will be presented separately on the TODAY page, and a tap on the picture will indicate the completion of the check-in of the habit;
3. A card will be pushed every day. When all the habits of today are completed, the card can be obtained and collected. Motivate yourself by jotting down your thoughts of the day on the back of the card.
【scenes to be used】
Work and workplace: formulate project plans, set meeting reminders, arrange itinerary planning, keep work focused, improve work efficiency, make business cards to expand contacts, etc.
Necessary for learning: Reasonably plan study time, set study goals, set exam reminders, open the learning master focus mode, improve concentration, and record study moments.
Life assistant: set small life goals, reminders of to-do items, plan travel itineraries, record shopping lists, and can also be used for event memos, making wish lists, etc.

